            <tr><td>Per-message fees</td><td>Segments of 160 characters plus carrier surcharges</td><td>Emoji and long links splitting messages into extra segments</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Discount cost</td><td>Code redemptions against recovered orders</td><td>Discounting subscribers who would have bought full-price</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Complaint and refund load</td><td>Support replies, chargebacks, returns</td><td>Aggressive winback offers that trigger refund requests</td></tr>
