      <p>For matchup-level decisions, the head-to-head pages (start with <a class="link" href="/compare/postscript-vs-attentive">Postscript vs Attentive</a> and <a class="link" href="/compare/klaviyo-vs-omnisend">Klaviyo vs Omnisend</a>) carry the same consent, suppression, and margin worksheets applied pairwise. If you are replacing a platform entirely, read the migration notes in <a class="link" href="/alternatives">the alternatives directory</a> first — consent evidence migrates before anything else.</p>
